      "label": "Example 1 &ndash; x terms positive",
      "question": "Solve 5x + 2 = 3x + 10",
      "steps": [
        "Subtract 3x: 2x + 2 = 10",
        "Subtract 2: 2x = 8",
        "Divide by 2: x = 4"
      ],
      "answer": "x = 4",
      "explanation": "Move the smaller x term (3x) to get a positive coefficient."
    },
    {
      "id": "ex2",
